# Host files of backup/borgmatic — format: docs/standards/host-files.md
# The agent is host-installed; rendering this stack is the statement that it
# runs on this host. The two units are optional because a packaged borgmatic
# may ship its own (README.md, step 8).
# source (relative to this stack)   target on the host                          mode  owner      compare   required
config.yaml.example                 /etc/borgmatic/config.yaml                  0600  root:root  derived   required
borgmatic.service.example           /etc/systemd/system/borgmatic.service       0644  root:root  exact     optional
borgmatic.timer.example             /etc/systemd/system/borgmatic.timer         0644  root:root  exact     optional
-                                   /root/.borg-passphrase                      0600  root:root  presence  required
-                                   /root/.ssh/id_borg                          0600  root:root  presence  required
